Assumption Lab"}]]}]}]]}]]}],[["$","h2","0",{"id":"where-manifestations-actually-get-cancelled","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Where Manifestations Actually Get Cancelled"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Ask any long-term practitioner of the Law of Assumption where they lose their momentum, and it is almost never during their 15-minute nightly SATS session."]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["It happens at 2:15 PM on a Tuesday — on Day 35 of their practice — when an unexpected invoice arrives, a client goes quiet, or a partner acts distant."]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["In that 30-second window of somatic shock, the old identity grabs the steering wheel. Driven by cortisol and urgency, the practitioner sends a needy text, slashes their consulting rates in panic, or spirals into three hours of mental arguing. By trying to \"fix\" the 3D emergency from a state of fear, they re-anchor the exact reality they were trying to leave behind."]}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["In Vibe Hyr ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"Course 04 (Navigating the Echo & Life Mastery)"}],", we engineered the ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"30-Second Decision Matrix"}]," specifically for that Tuesday afternoon moment."]}],["$","h2","5",{"id":"the-physics-of-the-60-day-echo","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Physics of the 60-Day Echo"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["To understand why the Decision Matrix works, remember the first law of ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Echo Theory"}],":"]}],["$","p","7",{"className":"font-body font-bold text-white mb-3","children":"What you see in your physical environment today is not a live feed of your current consciousness. It is fossil light — the delayed 60-to-90-day echo of who you used to be."}],["$","p","8",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["When an unfavorable event shows up on Day 35 of a new assumption, it has zero creative power over your future — ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"unless"}]," you mistake it for a present verdict and react to it with fresh emotion."]}],["$","blockquote","9",{"className":"border-l-2 border-orange-DEFAULT pl-6 my-8 font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT text-lg leading-relaxed","children":["",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"An old echo cannot perpetuate itself. It requires your fresh reaction to sign a new 90-day lease.\""}],""]}],["$","h2","10",{"id":"the-3-filter-decision-matrix","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The 3-Filter Decision Matrix"}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Before you send an important email, make a financial move, or respond to a triggering text during the echo delay, pause for 30 seconds and run the impulse through three filters:"]}],["$","h3","12",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Filter 1: The Source Check (Fear vs. Fulfillment)"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Ask your body honestly: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"Am I taking this action to express who I am, or am I taking this action to relieve anxiety about the 3D?\""}],""]}],["$","ul","14",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Ego / Panic Action"}]," feels urgent, tight in the chest, and desperate for immediate relief (",["$","em","3",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"If I don't send this follow-up right now, I'll lose them\""}],")."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Inspired Bridge Action"}]," feels calm, clean, and unhurried (",["$","em","3",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"It makes total sense to reach out to this partner today\""}],")."]}]]}]]}],["$","h3","15",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Filter 2: The Identity Alignment Check"}],["$","p","16",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Ask: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"What would the version of me who already occupies the end state do right now?\""}],""]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Would the sought-after executive apologize for their pricing? Would the securely loved partner interrogate a two-hour text delay? If the action contradicts the identity of the wish fulfilled, ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"do not execute it."}],""]}],["$","h3","18",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Filter 3: The Echo Awareness Check"}],["$","p","19",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Label the 3D friction accurately out loud or in your Assumption Lab: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"This circumstance is an expiring echo from 60 days ago. My new instruction is already in production.\""}],""]}],["$","h2","20",{"id":"practicing-in-the-assumption-lab","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Practicing in the Assumption Lab"}],["$","p","21",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Every time you catch a panic impulse, run the 30-Second Decision Matrix, and choose to hold your standard instead of shrinking, your nervous system records a massive victory. Within weeks, your default baseline shifts from reactive survival to calm architectural authority."]}]],["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"faq-heading","className":"mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-white/10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.52rem] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-orange-DEFAULT mb-2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":13,"height":13,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-help","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","1u773s",{"d":"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"}],["$","path","p32p05",{"d":"M12 17h.01"}],"$undefined"]}],"Key Questions Answered"]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"faq-heading","className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mb-6","children":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","